-- `density_grid`: 3D tensor storing density values $\sigma$ [S2, unofficial].
-- `occs`: 1D or 3D tensor storing continuous occupancy values $o$ [S1, unofficial].
-- `binaries`: Boolean tensor indicating occupied voxels ($o > \text{thre}$) [S1, unofficial].
-- `aabbs`: Tensor of shape `(levels, 6)` storing `[min_x, min_y, min_z, max_x, max_y, max_z]` for each level [S1, unofficial].
-
